  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 1",
  "verseCount": 45,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi evangeli ya Yesu Kirisito, Omwana wa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebanza nk'okwo Omurangi Isaya yahandikiire ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana akaba ali omw'irungu nayegesa abantu kabechuza amafu, bakagarulirwa, nashuba nababatiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yona ya Buyahudi yamugobaga, hamoi n'aba Yerusalemu bona. Ababatiza omu Mwiga gwa Yorudani nibechuza amafu gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana yajwaraga ekijwaro ky'omushenshe gw'engamia, yayekomaga omukandara gw'oruhu omu nyugunyu, kandi yalyaga enzige n'obwoki bw'omw'ishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarangaga ati, “Alikunduga enyuma manzi kunshaaga, tindagiirwe na kubandama hansi kumujuura biratwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbabatiize n'amaizi, kyonkai wenene alibabatiza na Mwoyo Mutakatifu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebyo Yesu aruga Nazareti eya Galilaya abatizibwa Yohana omuli Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayamazire kuruga omu maizi, aho n'aho abona eiguru likingukire, na Mwoyo namusongokaho omu mishusire y'ekiiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'eiraka liruga omw'iguru liti, “Iwe oba Mwana wange omugonzibwa, n'iwe nshemelerwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoyo ayanguha amutwara omw'irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omw'irungu omwo akamaramu ebiro makumi ganai nalengesibwa Sitani. Yaikaragayo n'ebigunju; kandi abamalaika bamutagaitiraga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yohana kababaire bamukwete, Yesu aija Galilaya naranga evangeli ya Ruhanga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nagamba ati, “Akaanya kahika, obukama bwa Ruhanga buli haihi; mwechuze kandi mwikilize evangeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire naraba aha Nyanja ya Galilaya abona Simoni na Anderea omurumuna nibanaga eishambo omu nyanja; nobona bakaba bali bajubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Mumpondere, ndabahindura bajubi b'abantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naho basiigaho amashambo gabo bamuhondera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayagenzireho akatambi akandi kake abona Yakobo eya Zebedayo na Yohana omurumuna, bakaba bali omu bwato nibashoborora amashambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayanguha abeta, basiiga ishebo Zebedayo omu bwato n'abakozibe, bamuhondera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagya Kaperinaumu. Yesu takelererwa, ahali Sabato ataha omu sinagogi abanza kwegesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batangazibwa emyegeshezeye, aha rw'okuba akabegesa nk'omuntu aina obushobora ti nka begesa ba Mateka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu sinagogi yabo akaba halimu omuntu ayabaire aina eiSitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likunga liti, “Notwenzaki iwe Yesu owa Nazareti? Waija kutumara? Ninkumanya oli ohai, oli Mutakatifu wa Ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yesu akabukira eiSitani elyo ati, “Silikwa mara omurugemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "EiSitani likabisa omuntu ogwo nk'owensimbu limara limurugamu nilikunga n'amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bagwa omu kitangaro, bebaza bonene bonkai nibagamba bati, “Kiki eki? Myegesheze emihya! AmaSitani nagabingisa obushobora mara nigamuhulira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niho honkai eiraangalye liraalira omu mukoa gwona ogwataine Galilaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu sinagogi Yesu arahukamu ataha omwa Simoni na Anderea. Akaba aina Yakobo na Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nyinazara Simoni akashangwa abyamikirwe omushwago, banguha bamugambira omurwaire ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aija amukwata omukono amwimukya omushwago gumurugaho, nangu abatagaitira omu nju omwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwaigoro aha kalemba bazana bamuletera abarwaire bona n'ababaire baina Amasitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigo kyona kisikuka kyemeelera aha mulyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiza abarwaire bangi aba kaishe ndwara, abinga n'Amasitani. Kyonkai tiyagajuburaga kwatura kigambo, nobona gakaba nigamumanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeire bwankya omu karo aimuka agya omu mwanya ogweheleire ashoma enshara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni n'abo yabaire ainabo abandi bamuhondera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagya bamubona bamugambira bati, “Buli muntu nahiga iwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagambira ati, “Tugendelere tugye kigo kindi nayo ndangeyo; manyasi ekyo nikyo kyandesire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araba Galilaya yona, naranga omu sinagogi zabo nabinga n'Amasitani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aijwa omubembe agoba Yesu, abandama amugambira ati, “Kawakwenda wakunyeza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aganya, aimukya omukono amukwataho, amugambira ati, “N'inyenda, oyere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho honkai ebibembe bimuhwaho, ayera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukomeleza, amara amutaishura bwangu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namugambira ati, “Oramanya otagira kyowagambira muntu; shana ogende oyeyoleke omukuhani, ogire n'ekihongo aha rw'okwezibwa kwawe: Nikyo kihongo ekyo Musa yaragiire k'abantu bamanyiraho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe kayaturukire abigamba obuzira koyasigayo, amakuru agamazaho ensi, na Yesu aba atakitaaha mu kigo nibamubona. Aikara wenkai enjai y'ekyaro kyonkai bantu bata nibamwijaho nibaruga embaju zona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
